    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>This project isn't a war simulator and doesn't depict real-life events or conflicts.</strong></i></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CAMPS</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CAMPS is an experimental framework focused on delivering an open-world tactical sandbox experience, providing solo and team players with the tools to experiment with a wide range of strategies, mechanics, and gameplay features.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE GOAL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main aim is to create a comprehensive open world tactical playground for solo and team players.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/extras/376feab105ac219c4f9fff7b2415a95f.poster.avif?t=1754903532\" width=564 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/extras/376feab105ac219c4f9fff7b2415a95f.webm?t=1754903532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/extras/376feab105ac219c4f9fff7b2415a95f.mp4?t=1754903532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>INGAME EDITOR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CAMPS provides intuitive and easy-to-use toolsets for creating user generated content (UGC) and distributing it to the Workshop.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/extras/259aa822fdde2e752d024ccf382d84d5.poster.avif?t=1754903532\" width=466 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/extras/259aa822fdde2e752d024ccf382d84d5.webm?t=1754903532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/extras/259aa822fdde2e752d024ccf382d84d5.mp4?t=1754903532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MULTIPLAYER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently, the game is soft-limited to 20 players per server by default configuration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom servers are fully customizable and can use a variety of settings and team-based gameplay modes.<br><br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/extras/a44cf4c5bdc4770f345ff91e5b3f5a6d.poster.avif?t=1754903532\" width=500 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/extras/a44cf4c5bdc4770f345ff91e5b3f5a6d.webm?t=1754903532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/extras/a44cf4c5bdc4770f345ff91e5b3f5a6d.mp4?t=1754903532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME MECHANICS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CAMPS provides a field for various experiments, allowing the combination of all types of game mechanics from fighting to flying jetpacks.   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/extras/4bcbd4f7ec6c0cbfb6c4574c0d74d681.poster.avif?t=1754903532\" width=518 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/extras/4bcbd4f7ec6c0cbfb6c4574c0d74d681.webm?t=1754903532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/extras/4bcbd4f7ec6c0cbfb6c4574c0d74d681.mp4?t=1754903532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>INJURY SYSTEM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The injury system extends beyond just characters. Infantry can suffer everything from bleeding wounds to explosive contusions, while vehicles experience engine failures, fuel leaks, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/extras/8d82304571d4ccd11d6ae724089b12a4.poster.avif?t=1754903532\" width=560 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/extras/8d82304571d4ccd11d6ae724089b12a4.webm?t=1754903532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/extras/8d82304571d4ccd11d6ae724089b12a4.mp4?t=1754903532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DESTRUCTIBLE ENVIRONMENT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trees, buildings, and objects react to your actions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The destruction system brings exciting possibilities, and future updates will expand the number of destructible elements.  <br>The game also provides ballistics, ricochets and various types of surface penetrations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/extras/2852553df9f576482d68b32a251c52d6.poster.avif?t=1754903532\" width=568 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/extras/2852553df9f576482d68b32a251c52d6.webm?t=1754903532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/extras/2852553df9f576482d68b32a251c52d6.mp4?t=1754903532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ARSENAL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game's current state offers a wide array of arsenal abilities, ranging from ground traps to artillery. The plan is to continuously expand the weapons arsenal, providing items to suit every player's taste.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/extras/7976a19014e7f8bf2c032c0ecec9ec96.poster.avif?t=1754903532\" width=500 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/extras/7976a19014e7f8bf2c032c0ecec9ec96.webm?t=1754903532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/extras/7976a19014e7f8bf2c032c0ecec9ec96.mp4?t=1754903532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>This project isn't a war simulator and doesn't depict real-life events or conflicts.</strong></i></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CAMPS</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CAMPS is an experimental framework focused on delivering an open-world tactical sandbox experience, providing solo and team players with the tools to experiment with a wide range of strategies, mechanics, and gameplay features.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE GOAL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main aim is to create a comprehensive open world tactical playground for solo and team players.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/extras/376feab105ac219c4f9fff7b2415a95f.poster.avif?t=1754903532\" width=564 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/extras/376feab105ac219c4f9fff7b2415a95f.webm?t=1754903532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/extras/376feab105ac219c4f9fff7b2415a95f.mp4?t=1754903532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>INGAME EDITOR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CAMPS provides intuitive and easy-to-use toolsets for creating user generated content (UGC) and distributing it to the Workshop.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/extras/259aa822fdde2e752d024ccf382d84d5.poster.avif?t=1754903532\" width=466 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/extras/259aa822fdde2e752d024ccf382d84d5.webm?t=1754903532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/extras/259aa822fdde2e752d024ccf382d84d5.mp4?t=1754903532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MULTIPLAYER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently, the game is soft-limited to 20 players per server by default configuration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom servers are fully customizable and can use a variety of settings and team-based gameplay modes.<br><br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/extras/a44cf4c5bdc4770f345ff91e5b3f5a6d.poster.avif?t=1754903532\" width=500 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/extras/a44cf4c5bdc4770f345ff91e5b3f5a6d.webm?t=1754903532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/extras/a44cf4c5bdc4770f345ff91e5b3f5a6d.mp4?t=1754903532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME MECHANICS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CAMPS provides a field for various experiments, allowing the combination of all types of game mechanics from fighting to flying jetpacks.   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/extras/4bcbd4f7ec6c0cbfb6c4574c0d74d681.poster.avif?t=1754903532\" width=518 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/extras/4bcbd4f7ec6c0cbfb6c4574c0d74d681.webm?t=1754903532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/extras/4bcbd4f7ec6c0cbfb6c4574c0d74d681.mp4?t=1754903532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>INJURY SYSTEM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The injury system extends beyond just characters. Infantry can suffer everything from bleeding wounds to explosive contusions, while vehicles experience engine failures, fuel leaks, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/extras/8d82304571d4ccd11d6ae724089b12a4.poster.avif?t=1754903532\" width=560 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/extras/8d82304571d4ccd11d6ae724089b12a4.webm?t=1754903532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/extras/8d82304571d4ccd11d6ae724089b12a4.mp4?t=1754903532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DESTRUCTIBLE ENVIRONMENT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trees, buildings, and objects react to your actions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The destruction system brings exciting possibilities, and future updates will expand the number of destructible elements.  <br>The game also provides ballistics, ricochets and various types of surface penetrations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/extras/2852553df9f576482d68b32a251c52d6.poster.avif?t=1754903532\" width=568 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/extras/2852553df9f576482d68b32a251c52d6.webm?t=1754903532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/extras/2852553df9f576482d68b32a251c52d6.mp4?t=1754903532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ARSENAL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game's current state offers a wide array of arsenal abilities, ranging from ground traps to artillery. The plan is to continuously expand the weapons arsenal, providing items to suit every player's taste.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/extras/7976a19014e7f8bf2c032c0ecec9ec96.poster.avif?t=1754903532\" width=500 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/extras/7976a19014e7f8bf2c032c0ecec9ec96.webm?t=1754903532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/extras/7976a19014e7f8bf2c032c0ecec9ec96.mp4?t=1754903532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
